==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*10 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~12 seconds<sup>60f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 2~13.33 seconds<sup>60f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master Da Xun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use Area Attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] for Master Da Xun. Close ranged units are welcome as well due to Master Da Xun's minimal range of 180.

